359
00:15:50,400 --> 00:15:53,790
除非你们的"总会"是指总会写错字
Unless the "Club" is the Poor Typing Club.

360
00:15:54,440 --> 00:15:55,100
好
Okay.

361
00:15:55,100 --> 00:16:00,840
现在来说你们的15%小"废"
Now let's discuss this 15% "gratooty"?

362
00:16:01,780 --> 00:16:04,140
对...  你这样也太没礼貌了
Yeah-- well, that was rude.

363
00:16:04,870 --> 00:16:07,270
某人要得不到小"废"了
Someone just lost their gratooty.

364
00:16:09,510 --> 00:16:12,660
谢尔顿  你得跟你哥哥道歉
Sheldon, you need to apologize to your brother.

365
00:16:12,660 --> 00:16:13,630
你说什么[抱歉]
I'm sorry? ?

366
00:16:13,630 --> 00:16:16,460
是的  就是这样  但面向那里语气好点
Yes. Like that, but nicer, and that way.

367
00:16:17,690 --> 00:16:20,380
我没有什么好对他道歉的
I have nothing to apologize for.

368
00:16:20,380 --> 00:16:21,900
我就跟你说这是烂主意
I told you this was a bad idea.

369
00:16:21,900 --> 00:16:23,420
有些轮胎是补不了的
Sometimes you can't patch a tire.

370
00:16:23,420 --> 00:16:25,160
你只能买新的换
You just got to buy a new one.

371
00:16:25,160 --> 00:16:26,480
其实永远都是这样
Actually, that's always the case.

372
00:16:26,480 --> 00:16:28,770
永远别补  汰旧换新
Never patch, buy new.

373
00:16:29,380 --> 00:16:32,600
虽然我挺欣赏你的民间轮胎箴言
While I appreciate your folksy tire wisdom,

374
00:16:32,600 --> 00:16:35,230
但我并不欣赏你让妈遭受的事
I don't appreciate what you're putting Mom through.

375
00:16:35,230 --> 00:16:37,110
妈遭受什么你知道个鬼啊
What would you know about what Mom's been through?

376
00:16:37,110 --> 00:16:38,190
你一直都不在家
You were never home.

377
00:16:38,190 --> 00:16:39,030
这样挺好的
Yeah, this is good.

378
00:16:39,030 --> 00:16:40,150
把不满都说出来
Get it all out. ?

379
00:16:40,150 --> 00:16:41,670
-不是时候  -闭嘴
- Not now! ?- Shut up!

380
00:16:41,860 --> 00:16:44,200
爸去世后你就去上了大学
You went away to college after Dad died.

381
00:16:44,200 --> 00:16:46,170
你觉得是谁负责照顾了家里
Who do you think took care of everything?

382
00:16:46,170 --> 00:16:49,480
妈妈啊  妈总是照顾好了一切
Mom did. Mom always took care of everything.

383
00:16:49,480 --> 00:16:52,640
妈妈当时魂不守舍  米希是个中二少女
Mom was a mess, Missy was a dumb teenager.

384
00:16:52,640 --> 00:16:54,320
只能我来一肩挑起照顾她们的责任
I had to look after both of 'em.

385
00:16:54,330 --> 00:16:56,080
我整天都有跟妈打电话啊
I talked to Mom all the time.

386
00:16:56,090 --> 00:16:58,020
她如果不开心会告诉我的吧
If she was upset, she would have told me.

387
00:16:58,020 --> 00:17:00,170
她是在保护你  你个白痴
She was protecting you, you idiot,

388
00:17:00,170 --> 00:17:02,790
你生活中我们所有人都这样
just like everyone always does.

389
00:17:02,830 --> 00:17:04,180
如果情况那么糟糕
If things were bad,

390
00:17:04,180 --> 00:17:05,560
那你为什么不告诉我
then why didn't you tell me?

391
00:17:05,560 --> 00:17:08,650
因为我也在保护你啊
Because I was protecting you, too.

392
00:17:11,070 --> 00:17:13,360
谢尔顿  你是我的弟弟
You're my baby brother, Sheldon.

393
00:17:13,620 --> 00:17:16,080
我知道你从小就过得辛苦
I know life has been hard for you,

394
00:17:17,230 --> 00:17:20,800
但这并不代表我们其他人就一帆风顺啊
but that don't mean it's been easy for the rest of us.

395
00:17:21,880 --> 00:17:26,090
我好像是没有想过其他人的感受
I suppose I didn't think about how it was for everyone else.

396
00:17:26,120 --> 00:17:27,800
算了  没事
No, that's all right.

397
00:17:28,150 --> 00:17:29,900
我知道你没想过
I know you didn't.

398
00:17:31,720 --> 00:17:33,290
对不起
I'm sorry.

399
00:17:35,430 --> 00:17:36,810
谢谢
Thank you.

400
00:17:37,110 --> 00:17:40,120
如果我的大哥能出席我婚礼
And it would mean a lot to me

401
00:17:40,120 --> 00:17:42,630
那将对我意义非常重大
to have my big brother at my wedding.

402
00:17:46,330 --> 00:17:48,050
我不会错过
I wouldn't miss it.

403
00:17:54,070 --> 00:17:57,030
是我错觉  还是我们刚补好了一个轮胎
Is it me, or did we just patch a tire?

404
00:18:00,840 --> 00:18:04,050
他说了"永远别补"  你不听人说话的吗
He said, "never patch." do you even listen?

405
00:18:13,590 --> 00:18:15,580
情况怎么样啦
Hey, how's it going?

406
00:18:17,830 --> 00:18:19,320
非常好
Really good.

407
00:18:19,330 --> 00:18:21,520
小乔治会来参加我们的婚礼
Georgie's going to come to the wedding.

408
00:18:21,520 --> 00:18:23,520
那太好了
Oh, that's great!

409
00:18:23,520 --> 00:18:25,390
你为什么不看镜头
Why aren't you looking at the camera?

410
00:18:25,390 --> 00:18:28,210
我是在锻炼我的周边视觉
Oh, you know, I'm just working on my peripheral vision.

411
00:18:30,160 --> 00:18:31,790
你在说什么胡话
Well, that is nonsense.

412
00:18:31,790 --> 00:18:34,250
你的周边视觉好得很
Your peripheral vision is fine.

413
00:18:34,250 --> 00:18:36,480
是不是那些女性杂志又让你觉得
Are those women's magazines making you feel bad

414
00:18:36,480 --> 00:18:38,280
自己这里不好那里不好了
about yourself again?

415
00:18:39,800 --> 00:18:42,600
是的  正是这个情况
Yup, that is what's happening.

416
00:18:43,260 --> 00:18:46,720
这话我跟你说过了  杂志上的女人全都靠修图
I have told you before, those women are airbrushed

417
00:18:46,720 --> 00:18:49,360
这次也是修了好看起来像有好视力
to make it look like they have good vision.

418
00:18:50,740 --> 00:18:52,430
话说我想到
Hey, I-I was thinking,

419
00:18:52,430 --> 00:18:54,500
现在你跟你大哥和好了
now that you and your brother made up,

420
00:18:54,500 --> 00:18:56,550
你也不用着急回家啊
there's no reason to rush home.

421
00:18:56,550 --> 00:19:00,790
或许你跟莱纳德可以多待...
Maybe you and Leonard could, could stay for, uh...

422
00:19:01,540 --> 00:19:04,500
两到三个充满欢乐的日子后再回来啊
two to three more fun-filled days there.

423
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:07,620
真是个好主意啊
That's a great idea!

424
00:19:07,620 --> 00:19:09,480
莱纳德  有好消息
Hey, Leonard, good news.

425
00:19:09,480 --> 00:19:13,390
我们现在有时间去参观美国铁路博物馆了
We do have time to visit the Museum of the American Railroad!

426
00:19:15,090 --> 00:19:17,240
我想拒绝  但说了又有何用
I'd say no, but what's the point?

427
00:19:22,830 --> 00:19:25,540
你最好别太接近我
Ooh. You might not want to get too close.

428
00:19:25,540 --> 00:19:27,080
红眼病
Pink eye.

429
00:19:28,380 --> 00:19:30,210
我也是
Me, too!

430
00:19:31,490 --> 00:19:32,900
-细菌性的吗  -是的
- Bacterial? - ?Yeah.

431
00:19:32,910 --> 00:19:34,810
一样
Same! ?

432
00:19:35,410 --> 00:19:38,210
我知道这话听起来可能很疯狂  但...
I-I know this is gonna sound crazy, but...

433
00:19:38,300 --> 00:19:41,170
你会有兴趣跟我一起去参加个婚礼吗
would you be interested in going to a wedding with me?

